  "summary": "Unbounded memory allocation during BDAT transaction in github.com/emersion/go-smtp",
  "details": "Conn.handleBdat disables the line length limit on the connection reader while reading a BDAT chunk and only restored it on error or on the final BDAT LAST chunk. A remote client that sends another command between two BDAT commands in a transaction bypasses Server.MaxLineLength, allowing unbounded memory allocation and denial of service.",
